# The upkeep trigger is a "may": declining leaves Squee in the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Squee, Goblin Nabob
Mountain x5
Mountain x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x5
Mountain x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Squee, Goblin Nabob.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Squee, Goblin Nabob)
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
Bot1.Decline
[T3 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Squee, Goblin Nabob; Black Lotus
